#- §6╔═.✵.════════╗
       §5Fractured!
§6╚════════.✵.═╝
§2Umm.. This is Dr. Link speaking. I was asked to record what happened by Sweetpea. I know we have our differences, 'science' should not have any part of this mess. But we have grown to know more about each other and
#- §2we share the same... 'visions'.§r 
§7-------------------§r
§8Research Log: Dr. Link
Location: /warp lab§r
§7-------------------§r
§8Observation: Sweetpea's Abilities§r
§7-------------------§r
§2I hate to admit this but Sweetpea possesses extraordinary powers. However, these abilities seem to be§r
#- §2amplified when §5ɨȶ §2is present, suggesting a symbiotic relationship between the two.

§5ɨȶ §2can exert control over Sweetpea's mind and body, causing her to act erratically and exhibit violent behaviour. She does not remember this and does not believe me when I tell her.
#- §7-------------------§r§8Experiment Observation: Separation Attempts§r
§7-------------------§r
§2We have conducted several experiments to try and separate Sweetpea from §5ɨȶ§2, but all have resulted in failure so far. 

Our attempts to use electromagnetic fields,§r
#- §2energy beams, and even advanced nanotechnology to extract §5ɨȶ§2 from Sweetpea's body have been met with resistance. 

§5ɨȶ§2 does not want to leave Sweetpea and fights against any attempts to separate them. Sweetpea insists this is not true.§r
#- §7-------------------§r§8Observation: Permanent Damage 
to Sweetpea§r
§7-------------------§r
§2During our latest attempt at separation, Sweetpea suffered severe physical and mental trauma. 
She experienced convulsions, hallucinations, and her powers went out of§r
#- §2control, causing some destruction in the lab. Our Warden and Giant Plant were not happy.
 
Despite our efforts to contain the situation, Sweetpea sustained permanent damage, including scars and strange markings on her body, and her mental state appears to be deteriorating.§r
#- §7-------------------§r§8Update: Hope Restored§r
§7-------------------§r
§2I was feeling disheartened and running out of options. Desperate to find a solution. After all, I was the one who gave her the Ender Pearl to join them together in the first place. My curiosity got the best of me...§r
#- §2I had to sedate Sweetpea for her own safety. 

When all hope seemed lost, one of my laboratory test subject's, named Pete, arrived by Sweetpea's bedside. I was initially skeptical, but Pete insisted on trying to help Sweetpea. 
So I let him...§r
#- §7-------------------§r§8Observation: 
Pete's Powers§r
§7-------------------§r
§2Pete's abilities were unprecedented. His deep emotions seemed to trigger an intense surge of energy that had a profound effect on Sweetpea. As Pete approached her, I observed a phenomenon!§r
#- §2I monitored their interaction closely. His huge beautiful eyes glowed bright, the light beaming down into her eyes... and §5ɨȶ §2started to weaken as Sweetpea grew stronger and 
somehow stabilized. 
Sweetpea regained consciousness and opened her eyes, now also glowing bright.§r  
#- §7-------------------§r
§8Conclusion:
I have no clue!!!!!!§r
§7-------------------§r
§2Whatever i've done to Pete has given him his own powers! Science, Magic, or both? I do not know. But it saved Sweetpea's life. The damage may still have been done, but at least she is breathing! It's a miracle!§r 
#- §2I don't know what else to say, other than... is Sweetpea's life really this chaotic? Is the magazine always like this? What on craft....§r
§7-------------------
§8If you know 
anything about Pete 
& Sweetpea's relationship status
please email me at§::
§7§nlinkslaboratory@
neveragain.com§0
