 §╔ ══----•●•----══     §1ᴡʜʏ ᴡᴀꜱ ᴛʜᴇ ᴡɪᴛᴄʜ 
ꜱᴏ ɢᴏᴏᴅ ᴀᴛ ʙᴜɪʟᴅɪɴɢ?
   ꜱʜᴇ ʜᴀᴅ ʟᴏᴛꜱ ᴏꜰ         "ʜᴇx"ᴘᴇʀɪᴇɴᴄᴇ!§ 
  §8══----•●•----══
#- §2Sweetpea! It's Dr. Link!
Please report back to the lab at once. You should still be under observation. You need more testing. I know you said you feel 'amazing' but I must urge you to come back. I can't find you anywhere, not your tavern, not the office. How you even got out of the observation§r
#- §2room is not right, you blasted the iron door right from it's hinges! Lucky for me, I found this magazine just laying here at The Graveyard. Why would you leave it here? Are you seriously working on another darn magazine!? I can leave a note for you that you might find... There are more§r
#- §2important things that need your attention... including your own well-being for one.
Come back! Right now!

Dr. Link§r

§6HA! I don't think so...
Ugh she ruined the book, writing in it like this. She is not the boss! Even the CEO is not the boss of me!
#- §6I was doing some thinking if she must know. I feel peaceful around graves. Must have fell out my bag. I am free now... the voices in my head are gone, i'm not going back. That cold, bright lab. No! Nobody can tell me what to do anymore. §2Dr. Link§r, of §6all people, should understand that...§r §r
