    §8/warp kitmuseum
§6└───   §c⋆⋅☆⋅⋆   §6───┘

§cAhh... kitmuseum. The 'once cave now not as much of a cave' with some very nice stuff too look at! A museum is not an easy task (trust me I know), so the effort is there and you can tell! I like the neat, tidy and
#- §copen plan space here. 
The collection itself is great! My personal favourite being the 'Donation Room'... because it has a whole wall just for my mags plus I may have signed the wall ❤☻

The Head Display is a sight to behold, I'm glad I'm not the only§r
#- §cone who has that many. The space is huge and looks like it has some more potential for more exhibits in the future if§r §0The Darkness§r §cdoesn't get them first.

Last of all I must mention the best part; THE SOUP! This is by far, the best soup i've ever had... ever.§r
#- §cIt's well-balanced, flavorful and comforting. A nice aroma, satisfying texture, seasoned just right, hearty enough to be filling, but not so heavy that it becomes overpowering. 

Anyone who tries it shall forever be converted!
#- §cGOOD SOUP! 
Buy the soup, 
love the soup, 
be the soup, 
soup is life, 
soup is everything! ♨§r


